5
00:00:12,875 --> 00:00:14,000
Sixteen false positives.

6
00:00:14,458 --> 00:00:17,750
Zero cases of two agents citing different values for the same fact.

7
00:00:18,042 --> 00:00:20,583
And the one time it did catch something real, a number an

8
